Package: validateR
Title: Simple Data Frame Validation and Quality Checks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ugyen", "Norbu", , "unorbu2019@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks a data frame for common data quality issues,
    including missing values, outliers, duplicate rows, and type
    inconsistencies. Results are returned as a structured
    'validation_report' object with 'print' and 'plot' methods for
    quick inspection.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
